Dear Jordan,

Thank you for the productive discovery session. Please find below the timeline and commercial framework for your proposal.

Timeline
- Proposal due: 23 October 2026.
- Shortlist presentations: week of 9 November.
- Contract award: early December 2026.
- Building handover: March 2027. Go-live must be before 1 November 2027.

Phasing
- We would like a phased go-live: the ambient area first, then the chilled zone about six weeks later.

Volumes
- Planning has now revised the peak forecast: please size for 4,200 order lines per hour, with 20% growth over the next five years.

Commercial terms
- Fixed price for hardware, software licences and project management. Integration work may be time and materials with a cap.
- Payment by milestones: 20% at contract signature, 40% at site acceptance, 40% at go-live acceptance.
- Pricing in local currency, valid for 120 days.
- 24-month warranty from go-live acceptance.

Service and support
- Support response within 4 hours for critical incidents, 24/7 during peak season (October to January).
- Please include an annual support and maintenance price for years 2 to 5.
- Spare parts held on site or within 4 hours' travel.

Training
- On-site training for 40 operators and 6 supervisors before go-live, plus train-the-trainer for 2 super-users.

Please treat the overall budget of approximately 2.4 million as confidential.

Kind regards,
Sofia Marques
